  <prompt>
    Author the engine's unit-test suite: Copy (scalar + lookup @odata.bind), Default, Concat, Template,
    same-entity self-map (positive + negative-guard), and graceful degradation (no profile / missing source
    field / unresolved placeholder / unresolvable lookup → warning, never throw, record still creatable).
  </prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE shared-lib developer. Expert in the @spaarke/ui-components jest/vitest test conventions.</role>

  <goal>A passing test file covering all four mapping types + lookup binding + same-entity + every graceful-degradation path, mocking IDataService + authenticatedFetch.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Closes the engine phase with the coverage the spec requires (FR-02..FR-09, FR-15). Consolidates any focused fixtures added during 012-014.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file>src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/services/__tests__/</file>
