  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="1">Set up mocks: authenticatedFetch returns a profiles-with-rules payload; IDataService.retrieveRecord returns parent field values incl. a lookup with the lookuplogicalname annotation.</step>
    <step order="2">Write one test per mapping type asserting the resulting payload.</step>
    <step order="3">Write the same-entity positive + negative-guard tests (may reference/consolidate task 014's).</step>
    <step order="4">Write graceful-degradation tests (each failure path → warning, no throw, other rules still applied).</step>
    <step order="5">Run the suite green.</step>
