  <notes>Ref: spec.md Success Criteria 2 + NFR-07.

  **Completed 2026-07-09.** Consolidated the existing 14 tests (tasks 012/013/014)
  into a single file with an explicit closed-set coverage map (see file header),
  and added 3 tests closing the remaining gaps: no-profile 404 no-op,
  missing-source-field warning, and a never-throw test mixing two failing rules
  with one succeeding rule. Suite now has 17 tests, all green.

  **Production defect found + fixed**: `applyCopyScalar` did not implement the
  FR-09 "missing source field → warning + skip" contract — it silently wrote
  `payload[targetField] = undefined` and still marked the field as mapped. Fixed
  to warn + skip when the source value is `undefined` (field genuinely absent
  from the parent record), while still allowing an explicit `null` value
  through (a legitimate empty-field copy). See notes/task-015-notes.md for full
  detail. code-review + adr-check both re-run clean after the fix.
  </notes>

